Package: trashwheels
Title: Explore Rubbish Collected by Baltimore's Trash Wheels
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Pratyush", "Kumar", , "pratyushkumar711@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides counts of rubbish collected by the four Trash Wheels
    in Baltimore's harbour, functions that summarise and plot those counts
    by year, and a Shiny app that helps community volunteers see which kinds of
    rubbish each Trash Wheel collects and how this has changed over time.
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
